{"articleNo":"192258","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=192258&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[근로]2018학년도 하계방학 교외 집중근로 프로그램 학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.05.11","hit":"5190","attachments":[{"name":"(학생) 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 희망근로장학기관 모바일 신청 매뉴얼(학생용).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=192258&attachNo=5896"},{"name":"(학생) 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 희망근로장학기관 신청 매뉴얼(180509).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=192258&attachNo=5903"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2018학년도 하계방학 교외 집중근로 프로그램 학생 희망근로장학기관 신청기간 및 매뉴얼을 아래와 같이&nbsp;안내하오니 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></font></span></span></span></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">1. 학생 희망근로장학기관 신청</span></strong></font></span></span></span></span></font></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #0100fe\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>신청 기간 :&nbsp;5.14.(월) 9시 ~ 5.25.(금) 18시</u></strong></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;[확정]&nbsp; </span></font></span></span></font></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청대상</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2018-1학기 국가 교육근로장학사업 1차, 2차 학생신청기간에 신청하였으며, </span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">국가 교육근로장학사업 장학생 기본요건*을&nbsp;충족하는<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"> 재학생<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 기본요건: 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(C0수준) 이상이며, </span></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소득분위(구간) 8분위(구간) 이하인 학생</span></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2. 신청 방법 : 붙임 매뉴얼 참조</span></strong></font></span></span></span></span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong>3. 안내사항</strong></span></font></span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - 한국장학재단에서 대학에 요구하는 의무사항 이행을 위해서 </span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \"하계방학 집중근로를&nbsp;활성화\"할 계획임을 알려드립니다.</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(신청자가 기관과 매칭될 경우&nbsp;예산 범위내에서 최대한 선발 예정)</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - 하계방학 집중근로가 활성활 될 경우</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \"동계방학 집중근로가 축소\"될 수 있음을 알려드립니다.</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 희망근로장학기관 모바일 신청 매뉴얼 1부.</span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2. 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램 희망근로장학기관 신청 매뉴얼 1부. </span></font></font></p></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
